      "side": 1,
      "message": "Filippo explained the suggestion to me 😊\nI still think I\u0027d prefer to go this route. I\u0027d rather see a test newly fail and add it to this list, than eagerly skip tests without noticing. If someone is using a custom environment that doesn\u0027t have go, then they can just not run this test.",
