      "writtenOn": "2019-12-05T20:16:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`go mod download -json` will be a no-op if the module is already downloaded.\n\nI\u0027m more concerned about the download failing outright on CI systems with very strict firewalls. (For example, a lot of distro packagers do their final testing with all networking disabled.)\n\nFor the Go standard library, I believe that `go test -short` never requires (or is supposed to never require) network access. I\u0027m not sure to what extent that holds for the x/ repos.",
